    {
      "subId": "2100420",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Soraya",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210042001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210042001": {
            "id": "210042001",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Sometimes fate is inescapable, even for a god...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042002"
            ]
          },
          "210042002": {
            "id": "210042002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I found four clues in four ruins.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042003"
            ]
          },
          "210042003": {
            "id": "210042003",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Four ruins, four clues... And there are Four Commandments.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042004"
            ]
          },
          "210042004": {
            "id": "210042004",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Each of these clues expounds upon the meaning of one of the Four Commandments.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042005"
            ]
          },
          "210042005": {
            "id": "210042005",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "To get to the correct interpretation, the original text of Guizhong's Four Commandments is key. These four are helpful, but peripheral to our enquiry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042006"
            ]
          },
          "210042006": {
            "id": "210042006",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "These five passages are all linked — but how?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042007"
            ]
          },
          "210042007": {
            "id": "210042007",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"Convergence...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042008"
            ]
          },
          "210042008": {
            "id": "210042008",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Hmm... Could \"convergence\" mean that... these four things all link up in some way?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042009"
            ]
          },
          "210042009": {
            "id": "210042009",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Wait — I remember, each of Guizhong's Four Commandments can be found in a specific ruin...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042010"
            ]
          },
          "210042010": {
            "id": "210042010",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Hmm... I am speculating here, but perhaps the four <color=#00E1FFFF>ruins</color> are relevant to deciphering the true meaning of Guizhong's Four Commandments...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042011"
            ]
          },
          "210042011": {
            "id": "210042011",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "How exactly, I don't know. I need to mull it over. Maybe you could have a think too — or better still, go and investigate it firsthand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042012"
            ]
          },
          "210042012": {
            "id": "210042012",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "I'm just a skinny little scholar after all, I tire out completely after a few seconds on the run... Wish I had your stamina!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042013"
            ]
          },
          "210042013": {
            "id": "210042013",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Anyway, I'm going to keep thinking about it for a while. If you think of anything, or if you find anything, you know where I am."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100421",
      "subQuestName": "Find the final clue",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100422",
      "subQuestName": "Find the final ruin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210042201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210042201": {
            "id": "210042201",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "It's a speculative hypothesis, but I believe the four ruins corresponding to each of Guizhong's Four Commandments may be relevant to deciphering their true meaning...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042202"
            ]
          },
          "210042202": {
            "id": "210042202",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Exactly what role the ruins are supposed to play, well, that's another question. And... I don't think I have the physical strength to test out each of my hypotheses in full...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210042203"
            ]
          },
          "210042203": {
            "id": "210042203",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "It's also possible that I just have a one-track mind, and this idea is leading me nowhere..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
