    {
      "subId": "2100450",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Soraya",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210045001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210045001": {
            "id": "210045001",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "How is the search going? Found the treasure yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045003"
            ]
          },
          "210045003": {
            "id": "210045003",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes, it was about where they \"converge\" after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045004"
            ]
          },
          "210045004": {
            "id": "210045004",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Really... So it's just like Guizhong's Four Commandments says. The treasure was located at \"the convergence of these four...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045005"
            ]
          },
          "210045005": {
            "id": "210045005",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Whoever designed this riddle must have truly revered Guizhong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045006"
            ]
          },
          "210045006": {
            "id": "210045006",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "So much so that they preserved Guizhong's Four Commandments for future generations, even though the Guili Assembly was wiped out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045007"
            ]
          },
          "210045007": {
            "id": "210045007",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "And as for Guizhong herself, who established the commandments — she must have been adored by her people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045008"
            ]
          },
          "210045008": {
            "id": "210045008",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Clearly, she wished for her people to be wise, to hold themselves to a moral code, to be strong and healthy, and to find solidarity in the shared enterprise of protecting their home — the Guili Assembly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045010",
              "210045017",
              "210045022"
            ]
          },
          "210045010": {
            "id": "210045010",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Failed? I suppose you're right, she died in the end... and when the Guili Assembly was wiped out, her people no longer had a place to call home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045011"
            ]
          },
          "210045011": {
            "id": "210045011",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "And yet, today, Guizhong's Four Commandments have seen the light of day once more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045012"
            ]
          },
          "210045012": {
            "id": "210045012",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "These were the words penned by Guizhong herself to serve both as maxims and blessing for her people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045013"
            ]
          },
          "210045013": {
            "id": "210045013",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Once there was a time when she led her people to go forth and take this very land, guided by these commandments.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045014"
            ]
          },
          "210045014": {
            "id": "210045014",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "She may no longer be with us, but her beliefs, the things she stood for — they will endure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045015"
            ]
          },
          "210045015": {
            "id": "210045015",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Whoever it was that revered her so much was very clever indeed. They used the allure of hidden treasure to ensure Guizhong's Four Commandments would be passed down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045028"
            ]
          },
          "210045028": {
            "id": "210045028",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Though for that person, I wonder whether the treasure they held dear was the rare metals and precious stones, or Guizhong's Four Commandments themselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045029"
            ]
          },
          "210045029": {
            "id": "210045029",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Haha, well, to me at least, it's clear that the commandments are the real treasures here. A chest full of gold or gems can't compare.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045030"
            ]
          },
          "210045030": {
            "id": "210045030",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...But if you made people choose, how many would really pick a list of commandments over material wealth?"
          },
          "210045017": {
            "id": "210045017",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "I'm not sure \"gentle-natured\" is a particularly common trait of gods...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045018"
            ]
          },
          "210045018": {
            "id": "210045018",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But maybe it was once. Maybe a long, long time ago, among the gods who led the peoples of the world, there were those gentle by nature.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045019"
            ]
          },
          "210045019": {
            "id": "210045019",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Those who protected their people... walked among them... stood by them as they went forth into the world...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045020"
            ]
          },
          "210045020": {
            "id": "210045020",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...But it was the gentle gods who were ultimately powerless to protect their people. Look at Guizhong — it took an elaborate treasure hunt just to preserve the four commandments that once were the lifeblood of a whole civilization."
          },
          "210045022": {
            "id": "210045022",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "You want to meet a god? You do entertain some wild thoughts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045023"
            ]
          },
          "210045023": {
            "id": "210045023",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But I'm curious, what would you say to Guizhong if you actually got to meet her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045024"
            ]
          },
          "210045024": {
            "id": "210045024",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "\"...Cheer up, Guizhong, you did your best\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045025"
            ]
          },
          "210045025": {
            "id": "210045025",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "If it were me... I'd recite Guizhong's Four Commandments flawlessly from memory.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045026"
            ]
          },
          "210045026": {
            "id": "210045026",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "And I'd tell her that her vision and her ideals were alive and well, that the people of this land still remember the things she taught to their ancestors.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210045027"
            ]
          },
          "210045027": {
            "id": "210045027",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "I think that for someone like Guizhong, who lost everything... That would be the only thing that could lift her spirits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100409",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210040901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210040901": {
            "id": "210040901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We're gonna get going.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210040902"
            ]
          },
          "210040902": {
            "id": "210040902",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Heading off? Well remember, if you come across anything exciting, don't forget to come back and tell me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100490",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210049001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210049001": {
            "id": "210049001",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Just what exactly is being hidden in this saying...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049002"
            ]
          },
          "210049002": {
            "id": "210049002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Tell me about the saying...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049003"
            ]
          },
          "210049003": {
            "id": "210049003",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Though we call it a saying, it's really more of a riddle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049004"
            ]
          },
          "210049004": {
            "id": "210049004",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "A riddle that has been kept alive by word of mouth among the residents of Guili Plains.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049005"
            ]
          },
          "210049005": {
            "id": "210049005",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "\"At the place where wisdom and ambition, unity and fortitude converge like water; that is where I shall reveal the bountiful treasures of the earth.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049006"
            ]
          },
          "210049006": {
            "id": "210049006",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "How about that, eh? However you interpret it, it sure sounds like there's some kind of buried treasure in the Guili Plains area.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049007"
            ]
          },
          "210049007": {
            "id": "210049007",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "If I surmise correctly, those four words should correspond to four different ruins.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049008"
            ]
          },
          "210049008": {
            "id": "210049008",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "If one were to find all four ruins, perhaps they would be able to find the meaning behind this saying.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049009"
            ]
          },
          "210049009": {
            "id": "210049009",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But I'm not cut out for finding all of them myself. Just finding that first one really took it out of me. Took days to recover.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049010"
            ]
          },
          "210049010": {
            "id": "210049010",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "If you're interested, perhaps you could take a look. Who knows, perhaps you'll find the next lead before I do."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100492",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210049201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210049201": {
            "id": "210049201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Remind me of Guizhong's Four Commandments.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049202"
            ]
          },
          "210049202": {
            "id": "210049202",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Having trouble memorizing them? I understand, most people would. Fortunately, I have a rather good memory for this sort of thing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049203"
            ]
          },
          "210049203": {
            "id": "210049203",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Guizhong's Four Commandments are as follows: \"Teach with wisdom, be bound by virtue, fortify the bones, unite in ambition — the convergence of these four shall be known as the 'Guili Assembly.'\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100493",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210049301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210049301": {
            "id": "210049301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A battle for territory between the gods?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049302"
            ]
          },
          "210049302": {
            "id": "210049302",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "A territorial challenge, you say? Hmm... but the Guili Assembly is said to have existed peacefully under Guizhong's rule for a very long time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049303"
            ]
          },
          "210049303": {
            "id": "210049303",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Not that Guizhong was a particularly powerful god... At least, that's my impression...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049304"
            ]
          },
          "210049304": {
            "id": "210049304",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But there seems to have been another god with the Guili Assembly besides Guizhong. I highly doubt anyone would have been foolish enough to try and take on two gods at once..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100494",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210049401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210049401": {
            "id": "210049401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Someone wanted the treasure?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049402"
            ]
          },
          "210049402": {
            "id": "210049402",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Unlikely. The great gods would not have waged an all-out war over a bit of treasure that took their fancy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049403"
            ]
          },
          "210049403": {
            "id": "210049403",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Or if they did, then you have to ask yourself... What kind of treasure would it take to drive the gods into war with each other?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049404"
            ]
          },
          "210049404": {
            "id": "210049404",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...Haha, I for one cannot imagine such a treasure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100495",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210049501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210049501": {
            "id": "210049501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Maybe Guizhong and one of the other gods...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049502"
            ]
          },
          "210049502": {
            "id": "210049502",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Wh—What are you suggesting? ...You shouldn't pay any heed to those tall tales you hear in Liyue Harbor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049503"
            ]
          },
          "210049503": {
            "id": "210049503",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Guizhong was a god, a deity... Not a mere mortal...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049504"
            ]
          },
          "210049504": {
            "id": "210049504",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...S—Surely a god wouldn't... Surely not..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100496",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210049601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210049601": {
            "id": "210049601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I also wonder...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049602"
            ]
          },
          "210049602": {
            "id": "210049602",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Maybe it's to do with the Archon War.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049603"
            ]
          },
          "210049603": {
            "id": "210049603",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "A protracted war erupted between the gods, each of whom coveted a seat at one of the seven divine thrones in Celestia.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049604"
            ]
          },
          "210049604": {
            "id": "210049604",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "It seems that none in Teyvat escaped the reach of that all-consuming war."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100497",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210049701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210049701": {
            "id": "210049701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Goodbye.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210049702"
            ]
          },
          "210049702": {
            "id": "210049702",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Goodbye. Don't forget to come back and tell me if you find anything."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}